 from a user\u2019s technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":179538,"global_rank":413379},{"name":"chiarng/extint_jenkins_demo","owner":"chiarng","html_url":"https://github.com/chiarng/extint_jenkins_demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"App for demoing Jenkins Plugin for ServiceNow CI/CD","topics":[],"score":179538,"global_rank":413380},{"name":"Coltonchristensen-charliepup/code-201-reading-notes","owner":"Coltonchristensen-charliepup","html_url":"https://github.com/Coltonchristensen-charliepup/code-201-reading-notes","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":179538,"global_rank":413381},{"name":"dblitt/ShulkerStore","owner":"dblitt","html_url":"https://github.com/dblitt/ShulkerStore","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":179538,"global_rank":413382},{"name":"addyg/NewsWebsiteCrawler","owner":"addyg","html_url":"https://github.com/addyg/NewsWebsiteCrawler","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Crawl news websites with Crawler4j","topics":[],"score":179538,"global_rank":413383},{"name":"erinsteiner-NOAA/fisheryconfidentiality","owner":"erinsteiner-NOAA","html_url":"https://github.com/erinsteiner-NOAA/fisheryconfidentiality","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Fledgling project to build tools to work with confidential fisheries data","topics":[],"score":179538,"global_rank":413384},{"name":"davidklett/katacoda-sce